      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.matt.bohairic:12",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ⲡϫⲟⲉⲓⲥ ⲁϥⲟⲩⲉϩⲥⲁϩⲛⲉ ⲛⲟⲩⲛⲟϭ ⲛ**ⲕⲏⲧⲟⲥ** ⲁϥⲟⲩⲱⲙⲕ ⲛⲓⲱⲛⲁⲥ : ⲁⲩⲱ ⲛⲉⲣⲉⲓⲱⲛⲁ ⲛϩⲏⲧϥ ⲛⲡⲕⲏⲧⲟⲥ ⲛϣⲟⲙⲛⲧ ⲛϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲙⲛϣⲟⲙⲧⲉ ⲛⲟⲩϣⲏ :",
      "english": "Now the Lord had commanded a great whale to swallow up Jonas: and Jonas was in the belly of the whale three days and three nights.",
      "source": "Jonah Chapter 2 (Sahidic)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ot.jonah.coptot_ed:2",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ϧⲉⲛⲟⲩϫⲟⲙ ⲁϥⲑⲣⲉ ⲡⲓⲟⲙ ϩⲉⲣⲓ : ϧⲉⲛⲟⲩⲕⲁϯ ⲇⲉ ⲁϥϣⲧⲟ ⲙⲡⲓ**ⲕⲏⲧⲟⲥ** .",
      "english": "He has calmed the sea with his might, and by his wisdom the whale has been overthrown.",
